  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:113",
    "name": "Design Process"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:114",
    "name": "From discovery to validation, every phase informed the next ensuring design decisions were driven by user needs, product strategy, and long-term scalability rather than visual execution alone."
  },
  {
