    "name": "Frame 91"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:173",
    "name": "Problem Space"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:174",
    "name": "Social platforms let creators build huge audiences but give them little control over who reaches them or how their time is valued. Social DMs are asynchronous and noisy. Clubhouse-style rooms are group-based and unmonetized for individuals. Cameo is pre-recorded, with no real-time interaction. There is no dedicated space for controlled, intentional, fee-based one-on-one voice conversations with verification and proximity-based discovery."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:175",
    "name": "Frame 92"
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:176",
    "name": "Frame 100"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:178",
    "name": "Key Challenges"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:179",
    "name": "For Users Comment sections feel impersonal; users want real, direct access to creators they follow, with transparent pricing and no hidden subscriptions. For Creators Hundreds of daily messages and unpaid advice requests make it hard to find genuine requests, protect privacy, and monetize their time beyond brand deals. For Existing Platforms Products solve either broadcast reach or recorded personalization, but none offer verified, real-time, creator-controlled conversations."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:180",
    "name": "Frame 94"
  },
  {
    "type": "rounded-rectangle",
    "id": "443:181",
    "name": "Influcrush (8) 1"
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:182",
    "name": "Frame 95"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:184",
    "name": "Opportunity"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:185",
    "name": "Creators increasingly monetize expertise and attention, yet no product treats a live conversation as a premium, protected experience. Cirqell explores that gap."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:186",
    "name": "Frame 96"
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:187",
    "name": "Frame 101"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:188",
    "name": "Creator Monetization"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:189",
    "name": "Creators earn fairly for every minute of their time."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:190",
    "name": "Frame 102"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:191",
    "name": "Real-Time Intimacy"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:192",
    "name": "Voice feels more authentic than text and more personal than pre-recorded video."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:193",
    "name": "Frame 103"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:194",
    "name": "Creator Control"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:195",
    "name": "Creators set pricing, availability, and who can reach them."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:196",
    "name": "Frame 104"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:197",
    "name": "Trust &amp; Safety"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:198",
    "name": "Creators set pricing, availability, and who can reach them."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:199",
    "name": "Frame 97"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:201",
    "name": "How I validated the opportunity"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:202",
    "name": "I interviewed users who actively follow influencers and have paid for creator content (Patreon, Cameo, etc.) [add number of interviews]. I surveyed age group, occupation and preferred communication style [add number of responses]. I compared Clubhouse and Cameo against the gap Cirqell targets. I developed one creator persona and one audience persona."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:203",
    "name": "Frame 98"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:205",
    "name": "Key Insights"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:206",
    "name": "Users prefer voice over text when they want authenticity. Verified profiles are essential before anyone pays or talks. Transparent per-minute pricing builds trust; hidden subscriptions erode it. Proximity-based discovery adds spontaneity and feels unique."
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
    "id": "443:207",
    "name": "Frame 99"
  },
  {
    "type": "frame",
