    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:270",
    "name": "Solution"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:271",
    "name": "Cirqell is a curated voice ecosystem. Creators control pricing and availability; users discover nearby creators by genre, intent, mood and interest, preview a voice note, choose a call duration, see the price upfront, and call."
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:273",
    "name": "Core Experience"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:274",
    "name": "Discover nearby verified creators on a map, filtered by genre, intent, mood and interest. Preview a creator&#39;s voice note before deciding to connect. Choose call duration with clear per-minute pricing shown upfront. Call privately, with wallet-based payment and creator earnings and withdrawals."
  },
