  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:311",
    "name": "Cirqell taught me to design trust into a product, not just an interface. Balancing creator control, user safety and a monetization model pushed me to make decisions I could justify with research. Next, I would test [add next step, e.g. call-quality edge cases, creator onboarding] to validate the model at scale."
