  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:361",
    "name": "A voice-first platform for intentional, paid conversations between creators and their audience."
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "id": "443:362",
    "name": "Cirqell moves creator-audience interaction beyond passive comments and unread DMs. It lets creators set their own call rates and availability, and lets users discover nearby, verified creators and talk to them in real time through private, consent-based voice calls."
